n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly\">Poly</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if `k` divides all coefficients and the constant of the given\nlinear polynomial.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.divAll","kind":"def","line":306,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.divAll","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L306-L313"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.div\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">Poly</span>.<span class=\"name\">div</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly\">Poly</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly\">Poly</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`p.div k` divides all coefficients of the polynomial `p` by `k`, but\nrounds up the constant using `cdiv`.\nNotes:\n- We only use this function with `k`s that divides all coefficients.\n- We use `cdiv` for the constant to implement the inequality tightening rule.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.div","kind":"def","line":294,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.div","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L294-L304"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def<